{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of the Vipunk, also known as the shield of Valhalla. It is your job to destroy and fight back against the invading robots sent from the future. Vipunk is a bullet-hell survivor game with a focus on deflecting enemies' attacks. Adapt, evolve, and overcome to drive back the robots!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chest arena:</strong> Every time you level up, a chest will spawn on the map, creating an arena. If you win the arena battle, you will be rewarded with cards. You can level up  11 times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/e6821e7a1c03028955a1c5a5f0192586.poster.avif?t=1772559599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/e6821e7a1c03028955a1c5a5f0192586.webm?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/e6821e7a1c03028955a1c5a5f0192586.mp4?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fighting style: </strong>In VIPUNK you never shoot any bullets yourself. Using the Shield of Valhalla you use their own weapons against them by parrying their bullets back at them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/dc85a50dbe0065a02b7972cfc49270e4.poster.avif?t=1772559599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/dc85a50dbe0065a02b7972cfc49270e4.webm?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/dc85a50dbe0065a02b7972cfc49270e4.mp4?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting stronger:</strong> Each run is different, in VIPUNK you have access to powerup cards, these cards will help you get stronger, they vary from &quot;getting movements speed with each kill&quot; to &quot;homing missiles&quot; Experiment with different builds and see which one you like with 20 different cards to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/852673a9234de49d441f3c9577263c68.poster.avif?t=1772559599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/852673a9234de49d441f3c9577263c68.webm?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/852673a9234de49d441f3c9577263c68.mp4?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replayability:</strong> Play on 8 different maps against many unique and challenging enemies unlock abilities and powerups in the form of cards, and experience very different outcomes each time you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/221379ae8743267bf7568633699aec45.webp?t=1772559599\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/221379ae8743267bf7568633699aec45.poster.avif?t=1772559599\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun progression</strong>: By playing the game you gain cyber points, you can use these to upgrade your base stats, you can also spend them on cards to permanently have a higher chance to obtain them in your next runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/3b6e8f028e347a78a948084a262f94e3.webp?t=1772559599\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/3b6e8f028e347a78a948084a262f94e3.poster.avif?t=1772559599\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge bosses:</strong> Fight different bosses, known as the robot lords, each with their own mechanics and ways to defeat them, it's up to you to find out how to beat them and drive them back from where they came from. 8 bosses to fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/dd58d94e25a30567ef5582afc9fded45.poster.avif?t=1772559599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/dd58d94e25a30567ef5582afc9fded45.webm?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/extras/dd58d94e25a30567ef5582afc9fded45.mp4?t=1772559599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2506420?t=1772559599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506420/page_